 },
 {
  "id": 1,
  "en": "Tenko, are you okay?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 2,
  "en": "WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHHH!!!!!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 3,
  "en": "I said all those horrible things to Himiko\nand now I don't know what to dooooo!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 4,
  "en": "Augh... I know she'd never hate me, but she'll\ndemote me from best friend to just a friend!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 5,
  "en": "You guys were best friends...?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 6,
  "en": "Well, if you round up to the nearest whole\nnumber, we were basically best friends!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 7,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>I feel like you're rounding up a\nlittle too much there...",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "en": "W-Well, if you apologize,\nI'm sure she'll understand.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "en": "That's right! We'll be like an old married\ncouple once we overcome this rough patch!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 10,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>Whoa, that was a quick turnaround.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 11,
  "en": "You should let Shuichi teach you how to\napologize. He's really good at it.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 12,
  "en": "...Really? That's the first\ntime I've heard that.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 13,
  "en": "Don't worry! I'll use my own words to\napologize to Himiko!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 14,
  "en": "Well then, see you tomorrow!\nGoodnight!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 15,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>Waving happily, Tenko returned to her room.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "en": "She bounced back rather fast... I guess\nI didn't need to worry.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 17,
  "en": "Ah, you were worried?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 18,
  "en": "...Huh? Is it weird for me to worry?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 19,
  "en": "...Do you want to die?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 20,
  "en": "...Ah!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 21,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>There's that habit again!",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>Well, I suppose on the positive side,\nshe's able to act more like herself around me.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 23,
  "en": "...What about the <CLT=cltSTRONG>ritual<CLT=cltNORMAL>? Have you given up\non persuading Angie?",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 24,
  "en": "I don't want to give up...but changing her mind\nmight require...less orthodox methods.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 25,
  "en": "I need to think of another way.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 26,
  "en": "Less orthodox methods... Got it.\nI'll think about it.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 27,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>Maki hurried back to her room.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 28,
  "en": "So Maki's going to think about it too?\nI didn't expect that...",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 29,
  "en": "But I'm glad.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 30,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>Especially now that I'm able to talk\nabout things more with Maki.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 31,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>I don't know a lot about this place...\nbut I don't know a lot about anyone either.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 32,
  "en": "<CLT=cltMIND>That could be a good thing...\nor it could be a bad thing.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 33,
  "en": "IN-A-PAST-LIFE, I-WAS...A-FISH.",
  "tr": ""
 },
 {
  "id": 34,
  "en": "I-GREW-UP-IN-A-POND-IN-A-RURAL-TOWN,\nBUT...I-ALWAYS-DREAMED-OF-THE-CITY.",
